'''''Papyrus, Read the Blasphemer's Will''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Through the Petals in the Land of Repose]].

==Steps==
# Investigate the remains of the black tide spawned monster
# Continue forward and join up with Hyacine
# Speak with Hyacine
# Head to the Library of Philia
# Search for the materials left by Anaxa
# Search for Anaxa's lab between the cornerstones
# Search for the materials left by Anaxa
# Have an audience with Kephale's divine vessel, and prepare for transmutation

