{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Murmuring Woods" Grove of Epiphany|Before heading to the Library of Philia, look for any documents left behind along the way.<br />Many documents were scattered when scholars fled from the black tide creatures.<br />There might be information about Thanatos.}}
