:{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Who are the Venerationists?
::'''Hyacine:''' The Grove of Epiphany is home to seven schools of thought. While all seven schools are founded on the ideologies of Thalesus the First Scholar, each is unique in its own way. Among them, the Venerationists revere and worship the Titans the most.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Was it a mistake to build the skyships?
::'''Hyacine:''' Nearly everyone in Amphoreus has heard the story of the skyships by now. {{Rubi|Aquila|Sky Titan}}'s stature is loftier than the heavens, and their divine retribution is merciless.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What is Anaxa's field of study?
::'''Hyacine:''' Nousporists primarily study the application of alchemy in soul repair.
::{{tx}}
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I don't have any more questions.
::'''Hyacine:''' Anaxa often says that... "Every failure brings us one step closer to the truth."
::{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

